flowchart TB
  visitor[Volunteer browser: isolated synthetic session, no password] --> cf[CloudFront HTTPS + VPC origin]
  cf --> http
  subgraph ec2[EC2 Python application · us-east-1]
    http[HTTP application]
    http --> human[Separate human evidence and hold endpoints]
    http -->|First manual start| agent[Strands agent: investigate histories, choose up to 3 open tasks]
    human -->|Accepted workflow events trigger follow-ups| agent
    human -->|Validate and persist evidence / receipts| db[(SQLite on encrypted EBS: snapshots, tasks, events, receipts, reports)]
    agent --> tools[Seven typed tools: scope comparisons, histories, work queue, briefing submission]
    tools -->|Read current state| db
    tools --> validator[Validate coverage and current task state; bind exact stored evidence]
    validator -->|Only complete current briefings| http
    fixtures[Pinned source bytes, hashes and reviewed scope] --> tools
  end
  agent <-->|Instance role| bedrock[Amazon Bedrock · Amazon Nova Lite]
  s3[Private versioned encrypted S3 releases] -.-> ec2
  ssm[Systems Manager maintenance: no SSH] -.-> ec2
  human --- boundary[Human writes are not model tools; no automatic release or disposal]
